# the first move; every turn's choices cross the cable before it plays),
# owner's two rig saves (NICK vs CLONEB).  Stand-in for Ruby<->Ruby (see
# em.fixture).  Oracle: each machine's own active-mon HP is the other's
# opponent HP after the third turn.
